      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, we'll need a bit more information to be able to help you with this.\nFirst of all, does this happen on every avatar you try? I haven't heard of anybody else with this issue so it's probably unique to something on your avatar. Especially try some of the public avatars to be totally sure.\nIf it is unique to one avatar, could you please provide the avatar ID that has this issue? You can find this on the VRChat website in the avatars tab. Navigate to the avatar then copy the part of the URL that starts with avtr_\nIf this happens on all avatars, then it could be any number of other causes. You could try switching worlds, toggling the dynamic bone auto conversion toggle, restarting vrchat, or making sure you have the latest operating system update.",
